luma-launcher (0.1.2) unstable; urgency=medium

  * The launcher window always uses the width from Settings and the height
    of its results, instead of sometimes staying at the small size it had
    when first shown.

 -- Mike Holp <mikeholp87@gmail.com>  Tue, 10 Nov 2026 22:32:00 +0700

luma-launcher (0.1.1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * KDE usage ranking counts application launches instead of files and
    folders an application opened.
  * Start at login points at the installed binary after a package upgrade.
  * Opening desktop shortcut settings no longer leaves zombie processes and
    reports spawn errors.
  * Destructive Settings actions must be confirmed within 5 seconds.
  * Desktop usage is re-read when the launcher opens rather than on every
    database write.
  * host:port input such as localhost:3000 opens as a web address.
  * Diagnostics no longer report KDE usage on other desktops.

 -- Mike Holp <mikeholp87@gmail.com>  Tue, 10 Nov 2026 22:14:27 +0700

luma-launcher (0.1.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Initial release.
  * Typed gtk-rs 0.11 interface with no unsafe code in the application.
  * Settings save automatically; font size scales the whole launcher and the
    system theme follows the desktop colour preference.

 -- Mike Holp <mikeholp87@gmail.com>  Tue, 10 Nov 2026 09:00:00 +0700
